---
<BaseLayout title={siteConfig.identity.name} description="Compare 115+ software tools across 23 categories. Side-by-side tables, pricing, and interactive quizzes to find your perfect stack.">
  <section class="relative -mx-4 overflow-hidden px-4 py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 via-blue-50 to-violet-50" aria-hidden="true" />
    <div class="absolute -top-32 left-1/2 h-80 w-80 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-indigo-300/20 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true" />
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-blue-300/15 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true" />
    <div class="relative">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">PickTheStack</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-slate-600">Compare 115+ software tools across 23 categories. Side-by-side tables, real pricing, and interactive decision quizzes to find your perfect stack.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
        {['115+ tools compared', 'Real pricing & feature breakdowns', 'Side-by-side comparisons', 'No data stored or shared'].map((badge) => (
          <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-brand" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.857-9.809a.75.75 0 00-1.214-.882l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 10-1.061 1.06l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 001.137-.088l4-5.5z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            {badge}
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
    <section class="mt-2 mb-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-blue-50 border border-indigo-100 p-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Not sure which tool is right for you?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">Answer a few quick questions and get a personalized recommendation.</p>
      <a href="/categories/scheduling/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-indigo-500 transition-colors">
        Find the right tool &rarr;
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-slate-800">Browse Software Categories</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {categories.map(c => (
          <a href={`/categories/${c.slug}/`} class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 hover:border-indigo-400 hover:shadow-sm transition">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 p-2 text-indigo-600">
                <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d={c.icon} /></svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-indigo-700">{c.name}</h3>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">{c.desc}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="my-12 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-slate-800">Why Compare With PickTheStack?</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Real Pricing</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">We pull actual starting prices, not enterprise quotes. Know what you will pay before you sign up.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Interactive Quizzes</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Answer 4 quick questions and get a personalized recommendation based on your workflow.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">115+ Tools Compared</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">From CRMs to VPNs, we cover the tools that actually move the needle for teams and solo operators.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="my-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-slate-800">Latest Software Guides</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <a href="/blog/best-free-scheduling-software-for-small-business-in-2025/" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 hover:border-indigo-400">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Best Free Scheduling Software for Small Business in 2025</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Free plans that actually work for real businesses, not just hobbyists.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/calendly-vs-cal-com-pricing-2025-which-scheduling-tool-wins/" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 hover:border-indigo-400">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Calendly vs Cal.com Pricing 2025</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Which scheduling tool wins on price, features, and open-source cred?</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/best-saas-alternatives-to-popular-tools-the-2025-replacement-guide/" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 hover:border-indigo-400">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Best SaaS Alternatives to Popular Tools</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">The 2025 replacement guide for cutting software costs without losing capability.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/software-buying-guide-for-startups-build-your-stack-without-overspending/" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 hover:border-indigo-400">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Software Buying Guide for Startups</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Build your entire stack without overspending in the first 12 months.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
